This folder stores portfolio-ready visual assets for the repo.

Recommended files:
- banner.png
- demo.gif
- screenshot-approval.png
- screenshot-memory.png
- screenshot-execution-centre.png
- screenshot-workspace.png
- social-preview.png

Use relative paths in README files, for example:
- `![Demo](docs/assets/demo.gif)`
- `![Banner](docs/assets/banner.png)`
